  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "introduction",
      "title": "Introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "media",
          "media": "m-f5b9c43a4f"
        },
        {
          "type": "richText",
          "html": "<p>Welcome to Compass International – Your Trusted Technology Partner.</p> <p>Established in 2007 in Sharjah and now headquartered in Dubai, Compass International LLC is a leading IT company specializing in delivering business-driven technology solutions across the UAE and the Middle East. With over two decades of combined expertise, we empower organizations through scalable, cloud-based ERP systems, customized software solutions, and comprehensive IT services.</p> <p>From our early beginnings, we've grown into a global presence with strategic branches in India (2012) for development, Egypt (2016) for outsourcing and support, and Canada (2017) for research and innovation. Our services go beyond software—we provide full lifecycle support, including training, IT manpower supply, outsourcing, maintenance, repair, and post-implementation services.</p> <p>Our highly experienced teams work collaboratively with clients from various industries—ranging from startups to government entities—to drive digital transformation with clarity, efficiency, and long-term value. Whether you're seeking Oracle E-Business Suite consultancy, immersive Metaverse experiences, or advanced infrastructure integration, Compass is your partner in progress.</p> <p>Let us help you turn technology into a strategic advantage.</p>"
        }
      ]
    },
